    <node id="&quot;BIOPHYSICS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"FIELD"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Biophysics is the field of study that Dr. Shakhnovich specializes in, focusing on the application of physical principles to understand biological systems."</data>
